    "m1": {"x": 2823, "y": 0, "w": 320, "fill": "teal", "text": "MOTION · Hero heading lines rise 16px (80ms stagger); photo holds a slow 1.05 scale. Sections fade up once at 20% (400ms ease-out); tiles stagger. Stat values count up; icons draw their strokes. Why-tiles: hover turns the tile navy, text off-white, icon tile orange with a white icon (250ms). Course images zoom 1.05; logos grey to colour on hover; marquee pauses on hover. Gallery hover: zoom + expand icon + Mono caption slides up. Footer: wordmark rises 40px, objects drift in parallax."},
    "m1b": {"x": 2823, "y": 620, "w": 320, "fill": "gray", "text": "NAV · Wordmark is off-white over the hero and turns navy on scroll; the off-white panel stays fixed and floating. Filled buttons always carry a white Heebo 600 label; orange buttons turn fully #B8410A on hover and the arrow slides 4px. REDUCED MOTION · no marquee, no parallax, no count-up, instant reveals."},
    "m1c": {"x": 2823, "y": 1000, "w": 320, "fill": "orange", "text": "CONTENT · Grey blocks are labelled photo slots for real stock photography of Indian students (caption = the shot to place). Review quotes are sample copy: swap in real Google reviews (20 words max). Footer objects are flat stand-ins for cut-out photos."},
    "m2": {"x": 2823, "y": 10991, "w": 320, "fill": "teal", "text": "MOTION · Story stats count up. Highlight and Why tiles fade up in reading order, with the navy hover state. Recognition icons draw in; marquee pauses on hover."},
    "m3": {"x": 2823, "y": 20893, "w": 320, "fill": "teal", "text": "MOTION · Filter bar sticks under the nav (white + hairline). Filtering cross-fades cards in 200ms. Card hover: orange top rule, lift, Apply Now turns #B8410A (shown on BBA). The dashed block shows the UG-filtered state."},
    "m4": {"x": 2823, "y": 26658, "w": 320, "fill": "teal", "text": "MOTION · Key-fact values count up. Enquiry card sticks 88px from the top on desktop. Tab nav sticks and underlines the active section on scroll. Accordions open with a 240ms height ease; plus turns to minus. Mobile: sticky Apply Now bar."},
    "m4b": {"x": 2823, "y": 27098, "w": 320, "fill": "orange", "text": "TEMPLATE · Swap course name, facts, specializations, semesters and careers per course. University cells are placeholders until the MBA university list is confirmed. FAQ answers: [content to be provided]."},
    "m5": {"x": 2823, "y": 37231, "w": 320, "fill": "teal", "text": "MOTION · Stat values count up on the navy band. Timeline line draws 01 → 05 in sequence; each node fills orange as the line reaches it (vertical on mobile). Benefit tiles use the navy hover. Logos grey to colour on hover."},
    "m6": {"x": 2823, "y": 45064, "w": 320, "fill": "teal", "text": "MOTION · Hero stat values count up on load (₹10,000 from 0). Steps 01–03 draw in sequence. Copy swaps to COPIED with a copy icon for 2s. Terms accordion closed by default (open state shown on mobile)."},
    "m7": {"x": 2823, "y": 52991, "w": 320, "fill": "teal", "text": "MOTION · Contact blocks lift on hover. Field focus: orange border in 150ms. Error nudges 4px once (off for reduced motion). Success panel fades in with a headset icon. CTA here is buttons only, no form."},
    "m8": {"x": 3880, "y": 57705, "w": 340, "fill": "gray", "text": "LOCKED · Every page imports these unchanged: floating nav, CTA (only heading and form / no-form vary), footer, university grid, partner marquee, mobile sticky bar. Edit once here and every page follows. Nav is shown in its scrolled state (navy wordmark)."}
